<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>GLITCH PROJECT</title>

  <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css" />
</head>

<body>

  <header class="hero">
    <h1>GLITCH PROJECT</h1>
    <p>
      projection / sound / signal decay / altered realities
    </p>
  </header>

  <nav>
    <a href="#video">VIDEO</a>
    <a href="#audio">AUDIO</a>
    <a href="#text">TEXT</a>
    <a href="#downloads">DOWNLOADS</a>
  </nav>

  <main>

    <section id="video">
      <h2>VIDEO</h2>

      <div class="grid">

        <video controls>
          <source src="assets/video/sample.mp4" type="video/mp4">
        </video>

        <video controls>
          <source src="assets/video/sample2.mp4" type="video/mp4">
        </video>

      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="audio">
      <h2>AUDIO</h2>

      <div class="audio-block">
        <p>LIVE SIGNAL MIX 01</p>

        <audio controls>
          <source src="assets/audio/sample.mp3" type="audio/mpeg">
        </audio>
      </div>

    </section>

    <section id="text">
      <h2>TEXT</h2>

      <p>
        Through projection, sound, and installation,
        the work explores the glitch as both disruption
        and portal.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section id="downloads">
      <h2>DOWNLOADS</h2>

      <a class="download-link"
         href="assets/downloads/zine.pdf"
         download>
         DOWNLOAD PDF
      </a>
    </section>

  </main>

  <footer>
    <p>Jess Bizer + collaborators</p>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
